<title>HONG KONG: Oriental Metals posts interim net loss.</title>
<headline>Oriental Metals posts interim net loss.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-09-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months ended June 30</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   6.0 loss   vs 7.54 gain</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    nil	  vs 1.5</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  45.21 loss vs nil</p>
<p>    Net			    32.70 loss vs 40.38</p>
<p>    Turnover		     1,284.35   vs 1,371.03</p>
<p>    Company name		 Oriental Metals (Holdings) Co Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  N/A</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   N/A</p>
<p>NOTE - Metals trading firm Oriental Metals is authorised by state-owned China National Nonferrous Metals Industry Corp to engage in trading of nonferrous metals.</p>
<p>Net is after an exceptional loss on disposal of an associated company and provision for loss from theft.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
